From 0b7c96ba9d84864ee63ccbfd26e815d4b57132a8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <claude@anthropic.local>
Date: Sun, 16 Aug 2026 19:52:59 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] Phase 6: resolution picker dialog + wiring to
 DownloadService

- ResolutionPickerDialog (BottomSheetDialogFragment) lists formats from
  HomeViewModel.resolveResult (activity-scoped, shared with HomeFragment)
- ResolutionFormatAdapter: ListAdapter/DiffUtil, same pattern as the
  existing DownloadAdapter
- sheet_resolution_picker.xml / item_resolution_format.xml styled to
  match the existing sheet_download_queue.xml / item_download.xml
- HomeFragment switched viewModels() -> activityViewModels() so the
  dialog (shown via childFragmentManager) shares one HomeViewModel
  instance instead of getting a separate one, and now observes
  resolveResult to actually show the sheet
- confirming a format calls DownloadService.startHttps(...) directly -
  the same call ShortsViewModel.downloadToDevice() already uses, so
  both paths converge on one download engine
- HomeViewModel.clearResolveResult() added so dismissing the sheet
  (picked or swiped away) doesn't leave a stale Success value that
  re-shows the sheet on the next observe (e.g. after rotation)

Marks Phase 6's Definition of Done complete in ARCHITECTURE.md.
